  <tr> 
    <td class="igheader" colspan="2"><a name="mwex"></a>Microwave studio </td>
  </tr>
  <tr> 
    <td class="igsmall" align="left" valign="top" colspan="2"> 
      <p>This is a tool for high-frequency electromagnetic field computations. 
        <a href="http://www.cst.de" target="_blank">MICROWAVE STUDIO (CST MWS)</a> 
        has shape modeler, including adaptive mesh generator, and powerful time 
        domain solver , as well as many useful utilities to deal with 3D field, 
        S-parameters etc. 3.10.03</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
  <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
    <td class="igtext" colspan="2"> 
      <div align="left"> </div>
      <div align="left"> 
        <table width="100" border="0" align="left">
          <tr> 
            <td><span class="igsmall"><img src="mw/circulator_03.gif" width="256" height="192" align="top" vspace="0" hspace="0"></span></td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <p align="left"><span class="igsmall">An educational example. H-plane 
          Y-typethree port circulator. On the center there are two ferrite disks 
          biased by a static magnetic field, as a consequence the structure shows 
          a non-reciprocal behavior: a wave propagates in one </span><span class="igsmall">direction 
          only</span></p>
        <p>&nbsp;</p>
      </div>
    </td>
